diff --git a/internal_fs/roms/README.md b/internal_fs/roms/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e70c40a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/internal_fs/roms/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Game Boy ROMs placed here are written to the board's internal flash on
+`idf.py flash` and used when no SD card is inserted. Only use ROMs you have
+the right to use (for example, dumped from your own cartridges).
